title: The Soldiers
subtitle: Will the Reichswehr shoot?
view-if: crisis_october = 1
on-arrival: month_actions += 1
frequency: 100
is-card: true
new-page: true
tags: crisis

= The Soldiers

Seeckt's army is small, professional and chosen for its politics. Its officers are monarchists to a man. Its soldiers are not: many are workers' sons from the same towns as the hundreds, paid in the same worthless marks. The Saxon and Prussian police are another matter again: Social Democrats run them, and many policemen vote SPD.

- @leaflets: Flood the barracks with leaflets.
- @police: Work on the police through their Social Democratic union.
- @officers: Approach the officers who hate Seeckt.

@leaflets
subtitle: Cheap, and some soldiers read them.
on-arrival: {!
Q.army_loyalty -= 5;
Q.crisis_momentum += 4;
Q.repression += 2;
!}

The leaflet is short: "Soldier, your mother is starving too." Sentries are doubled in Dresden after one is found in every locker of a battalion.

@police
subtitle: [? if lock_united_front = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Slow and uncertain. If it works, the police stand aside.
choose-if: lock_united_front < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids it.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_united_front == 1) {
    Q.unity -= 10;
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10;
}
Q.police_loyalty -= 6;
Q.crisis_momentum += (Q.spd_relation >= 35) ? 7 : 3;
Q.lean_unionist += 1;
!}

Police delegates meet our people in a Leipzig back room. They will not join a rising. Some of them say they will not fire on strikers.

@officers
subtitle: Costs 1 fund. A gamble on the national bolsheviks in uniform.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no funds.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
var ok = Math.random() < 0.4;
Q.e23_officers_ok = ok ? 1 : 0;
Q.army_loyalty -= ok ? 8 : 0;
Q.crisis_momentum += ok ? 8 : -2;
Q.independence -= 2;
!}

[? if e23_officers_ok = 1 : A captain in Döberitz and a major in Leipzig promise that their battalions will stay in barracks. ?][? if e23_officers_ok = 0 : The officers take our money and give our names to Seeckt's counter-intelligence. ?]
